WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:07.520
Hello guys, and welcome back to&nbsp;
yeagerists! In today's video we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:12.320
will be going through the story of Levi&nbsp;
Ackerman "HUMANITY'S STRONGEST SOLDIER"

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:17.280
Levi is the son of Kuchel Ackerman, a&nbsp;
prostitute who worked in the Underground&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:20.960
and was made pregnant by one of her&nbsp;
clients. One day, Kenny Ackerman,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:26.000
Kuchel's older brother, came to the city&nbsp;
to see her only to find that she was dead.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.480
There, he found a young and squalid Levi&nbsp;
sitting in front of his mother's bed.

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:35.440
In a rare showing of compassion, Kenny decided&nbsp;
to take care of him. He raised Levi as well as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:40.800
he could: teaching him knife skills, how to get&nbsp;
along with people, and violent behavior. Levi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:46.240
also learned to use his own inner power that&nbsp;
he possessed as a member of the Ackerman clan.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:50.560
Time passed and eventually, Kenny&nbsp;
taught Levi everything he knew. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:55.040
he did not consider himself as a good father&nbsp;
figure. One day, in the subterranean city,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:00.640
Levi started a fight which he won easily. At&nbsp;
that moment, Kenny decided to leave him behind,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.480
satisfied that he had taught Levi&nbsp;
the skills he needed to survive.

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:08.640
Later, he became a notorious thug in&nbsp;
the underground but eventually left&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:12.720
the place to join the Survey Corps.&nbsp;
Although he was at odds with Erwin,[30]&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:15.600
he ended up becoming one of his most trusted men.

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:19.280
Levi is seen leaving Trost District,&nbsp;
along with the rest of the Survey Corps,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:25.680
on the 56th Expedition Beyond the Walls—the same&nbsp;
day the Colossus Titan attacks the district.

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:31.520
While on the expedition, Levi sees a soldier&nbsp;
caught in the jaws of a nearby Titan and kills it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:36.080
As more Titans approach, Levi orders Petra&nbsp;
Ral to take care of the injured soldier&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:40.800
while he takes care of the remaining Titans. After&nbsp;
clearing the immediate area, Levi checks on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:45.360
injured soldier, who is quickly succumbing to his&nbsp;
injuries. In an attempt to comfort the scout in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:50.960
his dying moments, Levi assures him that he has&nbsp;
done his duty well. As the soldier dies, Erwin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:56.720
arrives and informs Levi that they are returning&nbsp;
to Trost. Levi is unwilling to turn back so soon,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:01.520
is forced to concede when Erwin informs him&nbsp;
that Wall Rose has possibly been breached.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:06.160
Levi arrives back in Trost in time to&nbsp;
find two Titans bearing down on four&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:09.440
soldiers at the base of the Wall.&nbsp;
He quickly kills the Titans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:12.880
and demands that the soldiers fill&nbsp;
him in on what has happened.[33]

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:17.760
Three days later, after Eren wakes up in the&nbsp;
dungeon beneath the courthouse, Levi assures him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:23.120
that the higher-ups will let him join the Survey&nbsp;
Corps—and that he himself will make sure Eren does&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:28.560
not get out of hand. Should that happen, Levi&nbsp;
says, he will not hesitate to end Eren's life.

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:31.920
After Eren issues a verbal challenge&nbsp;
to the audience during his trial,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:37.200
Levi violently beats him on the spot, mockingly&nbsp;
observing that while chained on his knees,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:43.600
Eren is perfectly placed for his kicks. Armin has&nbsp;
to restrain an infuriated Mikasa from coming to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:49.169
Eren's rescue and killing Levi. She glares at Levi&nbsp;
after the trial, seemingly unnerving him. Unknown&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:49.267
to Mikasa, the beating was an act in defense of&nbsp;
Eren that gave the impression that despite Eren's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.267 --> 00:02:49.360
fearsome Titan powers, Levi (and by extension,&nbsp;
the rest of humanity) could still control him.

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:53.680
After the trial, Levi hands Eren over to his&nbsp;
Special Operations Squad for the next month.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:59.920
They move into the old Survey Corps HQ inside&nbsp;
Wall Rose. Levi orders Eren to sleep in the castle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:04.720
dungeon so that if he accidentally transforms, he&nbsp;
will not cause problems.[36] During this month,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.720 --> 00:03:10.480
Hange conducts experiments to try to get Eren to&nbsp;
transform. If Eren goes out of control in Titan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:15.840
form, Levi intends to cut him out of the nape&nbsp;
in a manner that would sever his human limbs,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:20.560
which would grow back in any case. However,&nbsp;
Eren fails to transform, and his hands do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:24.800
not heal from his bites. The Squad decides&nbsp;
to postpone any further experiments.[37]

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:29.360
One day, while having tea with them, Eren leans&nbsp;
over to pick up a spoon and accidentally generates&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:35.040
a partial Titan body. The alarmed Squad threatens&nbsp;
him, and Levi has to defuse the situation.[38]&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:39.840
Levi tells Eren not to take their actions&nbsp;
personally, and that they have good intentions.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:44.160
Later, after Hange explains why&nbsp;
Eren triggered his Titan form,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:50.000
Levi's entire squad punishes themselves, and&nbsp;
apologizes to Eren for acting on assumption.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:53.120
During the 57th Expedition Beyond the Walls, Levi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:57.360
and his team are ordered to ride in&nbsp;
the safest area of Erwin's formation.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:57.360 --> 00:04:01.680
When the formation is suddenly attacked by a&nbsp;
horde of Titans coming at their right flank,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:06.560
they change course toward the Titan Forest,&nbsp;
and Levi's squad takes the central route.

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:11.520
Once the Female Titan appears, his squad begs&nbsp;
Levi to give them orders, but he continues to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:16.320
ride forward and look straight ahead. Eren badly&nbsp;
wants to transform and fight the Female Titan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:21.360
but Petra and her comrades urge him to trust&nbsp;
them, and Eren hesitates.Levi tells Eren that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:25.760
he is not wrong for wanting to transform and&nbsp;
that nobody can know the correct choice until&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:30.800
after they have made it. Whatever Eren chooses&nbsp;
to do, Levi says, he should do it and believe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:35.520
he will not regret it. Eren then declares that&nbsp;
he trusts completely in his squad's victory, and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:40.240
they keep going through the Forest. This enables&nbsp;
the Survey Corps to capture the Female Titan.

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:44.560
Shortly afterward, Levi gets separated&nbsp;
from his squad. He reunites with Erwin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:49.120
and prepares to extract the human in control&nbsp;
of the Female Titan from the nape of her neck.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:54.560
He and Mike attack her and try to cut her hands,&nbsp;
only to discover her ability to harden her skin.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.560 --> 00:05:00.160
After Erwin orders the cannons to be loaded with&nbsp;
explosives and aimed at the Female Titan's wrists,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:05.280
Levi, standing on her head, taunts her with&nbsp;
threats of violence, telling her he would like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:10.880
to face her in her human form over the deaths&nbsp;
of countless of his soldiers. In response,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:17.360
the Female Titan begins to roar. Shortly after,&nbsp;
Titans come at her from all directions and devour&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:22.160
her. On Erwin's order, Levi and the rest of the&nbsp;
Survey Corps elite try to protect her from them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:27.760
but they fail due to the sheer number of Titans.&nbsp;
Erwin orders the Corps to retreat back to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:33.360
Karanes District. However, Erwin notes that the&nbsp;
steam from the Titan bodies will make it difficult&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:38.320
for the rest of the Survey Corps to see the signal&nbsp;
flares. He then realizes that the human inside&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:44.400
the Female Titan may have escaped, and he orders&nbsp;
Levi to replenish his gas canisters and blades.

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:49.600
After the Female Titan returns and kills Levi's&nbsp;
entire squad and captures Eren, he and Mikasa&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:55.120
join forces to rescue him. Levi tells Mikasa to&nbsp;
distract the Titan but avoid trying to kill her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.120 --> 00:06:00.480
since she is able to harden her skin. Levi then&nbsp;
proceeds to attack the Female Titan, and after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:06.160
a series of successful attacks, he incapacitates&nbsp;
her. Seeing that the Female Titan is now helpless,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:12.160
Mikasa disobeys Levi's orders and attempts to&nbsp;
kill the person inside the Titan. However, the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:18.320
Female Titan swings her hardened fist at Mikasa,&nbsp;
and Levi is forced to pull Mikasa out of the way.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:21.440
While doing this, Levi injures his left leg. Using&nbsp;
the momentum he gained from the last attack, Levi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:26.400
then proceeds to cuts through the Female Titan's&nbsp;
facial muscles, causing her to open her mouth&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:31.920
and release Eren. He grabs Eren and flees&nbsp;
with Mikasa, whom he reprimands for having&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:36.080
risked the life of her "special friend"&nbsp;
for the sake of vengeance. As he leaves,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:42.320
he takes one more look at the beaten Female&nbsp;
Titan and is visibly surprised to see it crying.

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:46.720
As they enter Karanes after retreating, the&nbsp;
Survey Corps receives a hostile response from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:51.360
the public for their failed mission. Levi is&nbsp;
approached by Petra's father, who reveals that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:57.120
she wrote to him frequently. He tells Levi that,&nbsp;
as a father, he is worried about Petra's decision&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.120 --> 00:07:01.840
to dedicate her life to him, as she is still&nbsp;
quite young and has her whole life ahead of her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:06.720
Levi continues to walk silently ahead&nbsp;
without responding. A few days later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.720 --> 00:07:12.800
Eren is summoned to the Capitol for a trial to&nbsp;
decide his fate. Beforehand, Levi, Erwin, Eren,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:18.000
and the other survivors reunite in the old Survey&nbsp;
Corps HQ. Armin tells them his theory about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:23.200
the Female Titan's true identity. Levi, still&nbsp;
injured, does not participate in the subsequent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:28.080
operation in the Stohess District; during this&nbsp;
part of the arc he is only seen with Erwin.

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:32.800
During the supposed breach of Wall Rose, Levi is&nbsp;
seen accompanying Hange and the others as they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:37.680
head to Ehrmich District while they attempt to get&nbsp;
information from Minister Nick. Though he will not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:43.040
personally offer them any information, he agrees&nbsp;
to reveal the identity of a person who is able&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:49.040
to speak about the secrets of the Walls: Historia&nbsp;
Reiss. The Shiganshina Trio offer to help locate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:54.800
her, and in describing her, Mikasa reveals the&nbsp;
name of Ymir—much to Hange's and Levi's surprise.

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:59.840
Levi is briefly seen again at Trost&nbsp;
District, still sidelined due to his injury.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:05.120
After the appearance of the Armored and Colossus&nbsp;
Titans atop Wall Rose, a detachment of about 100&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:10.240
soldiers from all three military branches is&nbsp;
gathered. Some of the MPs express disappointment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:16.400
not to have seen any Titans nearby. Levi calls&nbsp;
their bluff by inviting them to join the Survey&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:21.840
Corps any day so they can go outside of the&nbsp;
Walls to fight them, whereupon they back down.

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:26.000
Levi visits Erwin when he is well enough to&nbsp;
talk and expresses sympathy for the loss of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:31.280
Erwin's arm. Hange and Connie arrive as well&nbsp;
to report on their findings regarding Ragako&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:36.000
village and Hange says that they support the&nbsp;
theory that the Titans were once human.[60]&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:41.600
Levi is initially skeptical because they have&nbsp;
never found humans inside the bodies of Titans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:46.800
even living ones, and is depressed to think that&nbsp;
he could have been killing people this whole time.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:50.000
Hange offers some comfort in that&nbsp;
there is no solid proof of that.

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:54.080
By contrast, Erwin smiles at the&nbsp;
news, which disturbs Levi to the point&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:58.560
he says Erwin is going to make him sick.&nbsp;
Since Erwin is exhausted from his ordeal,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:02.560
Levi notifies him that he has taken the&nbsp;
liberty of selecting members for his new&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:06.960
Special Operations Squad. He believes that&nbsp;
Eren needs to be pushed into desperation.

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:11.200
Levi, Hange, and members of their squads&nbsp;
retreat to a remote cabin where Eren and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:16.320
Historia are being hidden. Their objective&nbsp;
is still to seal the hole in Wall Maria,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:22.160
and if Eren can do that as a Titan it would save&nbsp;
the logistical costs of hauling out materials&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:27.280
like originally planned. When Eren says he is&nbsp;
willing, Levi gives Hange the responsibility&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:31.520
of running the experiments necessary&nbsp;
to test the limits of Eren's abilities.

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:36.960
However, Hange also wants to lay low because&nbsp;
Minister Nick has been murdered. After hearing the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:43.120
details, Levi disagrees. An enemy that persistent&nbsp;
will find them eventually. He also guesses that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:48.400
Nick did not reveal any information, as all&nbsp;
his fingernails had been pulled out. Someone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:53.840
willing to talk, he states, would have given&nbsp;
up after just one. Levi sees two paths forward:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:58.720
they can either flee before they are stabbed in&nbsp;
the back, or exterminate their would-be killers.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:04.160
Hange suggests they do both, and Levi notes&nbsp;
that this is exactly what Erwin would say.

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:08.480
After running their experiments, Levi receives&nbsp;
a note from Erwin and asks those members of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:12.560
his squad "dumb enough" to trust the Commander&nbsp;
to come with him. They manage to escape before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:16.960
intruders reach their cabin and hurry to their&nbsp;
rendezvous point. When they arrive, they are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:22.560
approached by a crowd that blame the Survey Corps&nbsp;
for the poor living conditions in Trost District.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:29.760
In the middle of this, a carriage comes crashing&nbsp;
through and appears to kidnaps Eren and Historia.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:33.600
However, the kidnapped ones are&nbsp;
actually Jean Kirstein and Armin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:37.120
in disguise. Levi and his squad track&nbsp;
the kidnappers to their hideout.

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:41.280
They attack the kidnappers before the deception&nbsp;
can be discovered and quickly subdue them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:44.560
Their leader turns out to be Dimo&nbsp;
Reeves, the merchant boss who was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:49.280
blocking the gate with his cargo the day&nbsp;
Trost was invaded. Reeves protests about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:54.000
not knowing anything and Levi suggests that they&nbsp;
go out and talk. On top of Wall Rose, Levi says&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:57.840
he is not here to lecture him, but&nbsp;
find out about the deal Reeves made&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:02.480
with the Interior Military Police. Reeves&nbsp;
reveals that there was no deal so much as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:07.280
if his company did not cooperate his employees&nbsp;
would be out of jobs and he would be dead.

00:11:07.280 --> 00:11:13.280
Though the Reeves Company does a lot of good for&nbsp;
Trost, Levi recognizes that this will not last and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:18.400
compares Reeves' fight with the Military Police&nbsp;
to that of the Survey Corps against the Titans.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:23.840
So that Reeves will fight too, Levi offers to&nbsp;
hand over Eren and Historia on three conditions:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:29.200
the Reeves Company will work against the Interior&nbsp;
Military Police together with the Survey Corps,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:33.600
the Reeves Company will trust the Survey Corps&nbsp;
completely, and the Survey Corps will receive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:39.360
priority access to any luxury goods. It is a hard&nbsp;
bargain, but Reeves agrees and baits Djel Sannes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:44.640
and Ralph of the Interior First Squad into a trap&nbsp;
so that they can be captured by the Survey Corps.

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:49.360
In hiding below ground, Levi and Hange begin&nbsp;
work on Sannes, who proves difficult to crack,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:53.600
even after being beaten and having his&nbsp;
fingernails removed to equal the treatment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:59.200
received by Minister Nick. Sannes expresses some&nbsp;
remorse for the torture he has had to inflict,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:02.880
but believes it was necessary to&nbsp;
maintain peace within the Walls.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:07.200
Levi is unsympathetic and suggests&nbsp;
beginning Sannes' torture properly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:11.920
if he does not answer questions correctly,&nbsp;
starting with the identity of the Reiss family.

00:12:11.920 --> 00:12:16.480
Rather than giving in to the torture,&nbsp;
Sannes goads them into tormenting him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:20.960
further. He knows what it is like to&nbsp;
be the torturer and the power it gives.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:26.000
Disgusted, Levi suggests they take a break,&nbsp;
and they leave the door open a crack behind&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:31.760
them. This allows Sannes to overhear a staged&nbsp;
conversation between Levi and Ralph, where Levi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:31.760 --> 00:12:37.440
claims that Ralph told them everything and Ralph&nbsp;
in turn pretends to have no care for Sannes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:42.880
calling him a pain, and asking if there will be a&nbsp;
bed in his cell. Levi adds that if Sannes speaks,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:47.040
the two of them can even be housed in the&nbsp;
same cell together later. This is enough&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:52.160
to break Sannes and he confesses that the&nbsp;
Reiss family is the true royal bloodline.

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:55.760
Dimo Reeves and his employees are&nbsp;
killed and the murders pinned on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:55.760 --> 00:12:59.920
the Survey Corps. While his squad waits in&nbsp;
an alley for their part in the rescue plan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:05.600
Levi along with most of Hange's manages to catch&nbsp;
up with the First Interior Squad in town and spy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:10.880
on the hearse and coffins that they suspect are&nbsp;
carrying Eren and Historia. Levi is disturbed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:15.280
that the First Squad figured out the Reeves&nbsp;
Company deception, because that would require&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:15.280 --> 00:13:20.880
thinking like him, or perhaps more like "Kenny&nbsp;
the Ripper." Nifa calls him an urban legend,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:25.360
but Levi assures her that he is real and&nbsp;
that they lived together when he was a kid.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:29.920
He notices how the tactics he uses&nbsp;
are strongly influenced by Kenny.

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:35.600
As he realizes this, Kenny Ackerman appears behind&nbsp;
him, wearing vertical maneuvering equipment that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:40.960
is modified to work with guns for killing humans.&nbsp;
Levi narrowly dodges being shot, but Nifa is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:42.080
killed instantly. Elsewhere around the stakeout,&nbsp;
Keiji and the goggled soldier are killed as well.

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:47.040
Levi throws one of his blades at Kenny and dodges&nbsp;
his next shot by throwing his cloak as cover.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:50.800
He makes a break for it, frustrated&nbsp;
that Kenny can read all of his moves&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:55.680
and shocked that Kenny of all people has become&nbsp;
an MP. Members of the Anti-Personnel Control&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:57.360
Squad ambush Levi, using vertical maneuvering&nbsp;
equipment modified for use with firearms, and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:57.360 --> 00:14:01.440
he takes cover in a bar to avoid&nbsp;
being shot. Kenny follows him inside.

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:04.880
The two of them exchange barbs about&nbsp;
their past and while Kenny talks,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:09.360
Levi takes the opportunity to load the&nbsp;
barkeeper's rifle and reposition an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:14.640
alcohol bottle, allowing him to see Kenny in its&nbsp;
reflection. Kenny figures that Levi joined the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:19.200
Survey Corps for the same reason he joined the&nbsp;
Military Police. He found something he wanted to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:25.280
do and hobbies make life worth living. When Levi&nbsp;
asks if killing his soldiers is a part of that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:30.560
Kenny admits he will kill anyone if it gets&nbsp;
the job done and says Levi would do the same.

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:35.680
Levi agrees and shoots Kenny by aiming with the&nbsp;
bottle's reflection. The shot hits the chair&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:40.880
Kenny is holding, but is still strong enough&nbsp;
to throw him back outside and Levi takes the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:45.840
opportunity to escape. He tosses a chair through&nbsp;
a window to distract the squad members outside&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:45.840 --> 00:14:50.640
before emerging himself and firing a grappling&nbsp;
line into the throat of the nearest one.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:53.280
The remaining two members nearby prepare to fire,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:58.000
but Levi uses the dead man as a meat&nbsp;
shield so that he can get in close in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:04.000
and kill them. He continues to flee and curses&nbsp;
that there are still over ten pursuers left.

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:08.080
Levi catches up with his squad while the&nbsp;
Anti-Personnel Squad is chasing him. He kills&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:12.720
one of the MPs before landing in Armin's wagon&nbsp;
and orders them to stop following the hearse.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:18.080
Their plan has leaked and now Eren and Historia&nbsp;
are being used as bait to kill them. As they make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:22.000
their escape, he tells his squad that they&nbsp;
must kill their pursuers whenever they have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:27.280
the opportunity, but Jean is unable to do so&nbsp;
and finds himself on the wrong side of a gun.

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:32.560
Before Jean can be slain, Armin uses his pistol&nbsp;
to lethally shoot the MP and save his life.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:36.880
Though Levi's squad escapes intact,&nbsp;
Armin is deeply bothered by the fact&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:36.880 --> 00:15:41.520
he was willing to kill someone and Levi explains&nbsp;
to him that he was able to pull the trigger&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:46.720
because he knew that if he did not, then Jean&nbsp;
would have died. Jean admits he thought Levi's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:51.120
way of doing things was wrong, but it was&nbsp;
more that he did not want to hurt other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:51.120 --> 00:15:54.960
people. He will fire next time. Levi agrees&nbsp;
that Jean's softness put them in a bad spot,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:54.960 --> 00:15:59.600
but he does not know what is right or&nbsp;
wrong and Jean might not have been wrong.

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:04.640
Levi and his squad trap Marlowe Freudenberg and&nbsp;
Hitch Dreyse, who have been sent into the forest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:09.520
to look for Survey Corps soldiers. They take&nbsp;
their uniforms with the intention of infiltrating&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:14.800
the Military Police to find out where Eren and&nbsp;
Historia have been taken. Before he can announce&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:19.600
their fates, Hitch challenges him over the&nbsp;
civilian deaths in Stohess District and berates&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:19.600 --> 00:16:24.080
his squad over the disappearance and presumed&nbsp;
death of Annie, who she never really got to know.

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:28.320
Levi corrects her about Annie's true state, in&nbsp;
that she was the Titan hiding in Stohess and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:33.760
she is currently being held, though that is not&nbsp;
likely a fact they want new recruits to know.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:38.400
It bothers him that collectively so many people&nbsp;
are in the dark about the truth of their world.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:43.200
Marlowe asks if the Survey Corps really killed the&nbsp;
people from the Reeves Company and Levi replies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:49.840
that it was the Interior Military Police, which&nbsp;
causes Marlowe to offer helping him to set things&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:51.840
right. He would be more effective as an actual MP&nbsp;
than Levi's disguised soldiers. Levi is skeptical,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:51.840 --> 00:16:56.000
but Jean steps in and asks if he&nbsp;
can handle this. Levi allows it.

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:59.120
Jean tests their character to&nbsp;
see where their hearts truly lie&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:04.480
and when it is clear they have no intention of&nbsp;
killing him or following their original orders,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:09.760
he believes this is enough to convince Levi&nbsp;
to trust them. Levi and his squad use the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:14.880
information gathered by Hitch and Marlowe to&nbsp;
attack an Interior Military Police compound.

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:19.280
The infiltration goes successfully,&nbsp;
with the Interior MPs being disabled&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:22.960
rather than killed, but they&nbsp;
do not find Eren and Historia.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:28.160
Levi and his squad depart with one hostage&nbsp;
who Levi interrogates about their location,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:33.760
but the MP refuses to talk, instead spouting&nbsp;
off about how the Survey Corps will be lucky&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:39.040
to survive and how Erwin and the other captured&nbsp;
soldiers will be executed. He tells Levi that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:43.760
their only option is to surrender and hope&nbsp;
that enough to spare their comrades' lives.

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:48.080
Undeterred, Levi asks again where&nbsp;
Eren and "Krista" are located.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:52.960
The MP is surprised that Levi would give up&nbsp;
on his comrades, but Levi doubts the crown&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:58.080
would spare them and savagely twists and breaks&nbsp;
the MP's arm for not answering his question.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:58.080 --> 00:18:02.880
The third time he asks about Eren and&nbsp;
"Krista" the MP is panicked and confesses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:07.600
that he does not know where they are. Kenny&nbsp;
Ackerman is extremely tight-lipped about it.

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:12.400
Both Levi and Mikasa are surprised to hear the&nbsp;
last name, but they are interrupted by people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:17.280
approaching on foot before they can question the&nbsp;
MP further. The squad prepares to do an ambush.

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:21.200
However, the newcomers turn out to be Hange&nbsp;
along with Marlowe and Hitch, who have come&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:25.600
with good news. The false charges against the&nbsp;
Survey Corps have been dropped and the capital&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:31.280
is now under the control of Commander-in-Chief&nbsp;
Darius Zackly. Levi's squad celebrates and he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:31.280 --> 00:18:35.760
asks what in the world could have been done to&nbsp;
accomplish this. Hange answers that it was the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:41.440
individual choices of many people that changed&nbsp;
their world. He apologizes for losing Keiji, Nifa,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:41.440 --> 00:18:47.040
and Goggles, but Hange finds hope in the fact&nbsp;
that their sacrifice enabled Levi to beat the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:52.240
First Interior Squad, to which Levi admits that&nbsp;
their leader and his team are still out there.

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:57.200
Hange has a lead though and suspects that Eren&nbsp;
is going to be eaten in order to obtain his Titan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:57.200 --> 00:19:02.320
power. Erwin had a report commissioned on the&nbsp;
Reiss estate, and assuming that Eren and Historia&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:07.440
were captured by the Reiss family, that is likely&nbsp;
where they are being held. The day Wall Maria fell&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:12.000
a group of bandits burned down the village&nbsp;
chapel while the Reiss family was inside,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:17.120
massacring everyone except for Rod Reiss.&nbsp;
Days later he initiated contact with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:21.840
Historia. Levi concludes that there must&nbsp;
be something special about her bloodline.

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:26.400
The destroyed chapel is what interests&nbsp;
Hange though, because fire should not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:32.160
have torn down a stone building, and then Rod&nbsp;
Reiss rebuilt the place with his own assets.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:32.160 --> 00:19:37.120
There is something strange about all that.&nbsp;
Levi agrees and has everyone head there.

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:41.440
He warns his squad that Kenny will be their&nbsp;
biggest obstacle, because fighting him will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:41.440 --> 00:19:47.280
be like fighting Levi himself. Levi asks Mikasa&nbsp;
if she thinks Kenny might be related to her since&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:52.080
they share the same last name, Ackerman, but&nbsp;
she does not directly answer. She only knows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:57.200
that her father's family was persecuted, and&nbsp;
not the reason why. Levi then asks her whether&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:57.200 --> 00:20:02.240
she experienced a moment when she felt a sudden&nbsp;
power awaken inside her. Upon confirming this,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:02.240 --> 00:20:07.280
Levi tells Mikasa that he and Kenny also&nbsp;
experienced such moments in their lives.

00:20:07.280 --> 00:20:10.880
They arrive at the chapel and find&nbsp;
the secret door leading underground.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:10.880 --> 00:20:16.080
Levi and the others make preparations for facing&nbsp;
the Anti-Personnel Control Squad, which is waiting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:21.040
for them below. The group sends barrels of&nbsp;
gunpowder and bags of oil down the stairs,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:25.920
setting fire to them and filling the underground&nbsp;
chamber with smoke, reducing visibility and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:31.040
the usefulness of firearms. Most of the squad&nbsp;
exacerbates the problem with signal flares while&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:36.800
Levi and Mikasa Scout out their enemies. Levi&nbsp;
calls for his squad to take them down and the team&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:36.800 --> 00:20:42.240
springs into action. After a concerted push, they&nbsp;
manage to drive back the Anti-Personnel Squad.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:47.440
Levi leaves Armin to take care of an injured&nbsp;
Hange while he and the others chase after them.

00:20:47.440 --> 00:20:52.400
The squad finds Rod Reiss transforming into&nbsp;
a Titan and Historia trying to free Eren&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:58.880
from his chains. When she is blown back, Levi,&nbsp;
Connie, and Jean take the keys to help free him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:58.880 --> 00:21:03.280
Making matters worse, the roof begins&nbsp;
to collapse from the size of Rod's Titan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:08.320
and the team is trapped against the wall of&nbsp;
the chamber. Eren is hesitant to act until&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:14.000
Levi pushes him to make a choice, just like he&nbsp;
did back when they were facing the Female Titan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:18.080
The memory is enough to get Eren on his&nbsp;
feet. He grabs the "Armor" bottle that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:22.720
had fallen out of Rod's bag and breaks it&nbsp;
between his teeth as he transforms.[98]&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:28.240
Eren's Titan form then crystallizes, stabilizing&nbsp;
the cavern around the squad, preventing them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:33.600
from being crushed. Even after he is cut out&nbsp;
of it, his hardened form does not disappear,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:39.120
which Levi states is a huge development, as&nbsp;
they can now seal the hole in Wall Maria.

00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:42.320
Levi and his squad exit the cavern&nbsp;
through a hole made in the ceiling&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:47.040
above and see the trail of destruction&nbsp;
left in the wake of Rod Reiss' Titan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:51.520
Armin believes it is an abnormal since it&nbsp;
is ignoring them and Levi tells everyone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:51.520 --> 00:21:56.320
that they are going after it. Eren entertains&nbsp;
the possibility of getting eaten by Rod, since&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:56.320 --> 00:22:01.600
that would turn him back into a human who would&nbsp;
then have the powers of the Progenitor Titan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:01.600 --> 00:22:03.787
but Levi disabuses him of the notion. Even&nbsp;
if they turn Rod Reiss back into a human,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:03.787 --> 00:22:04.000
they would still have to undo the First King's&nbsp;
brainwashing in order to get him to help them.

00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:08.000
Levi begrudgingly allows Historia to&nbsp;
take part in the attack against Rod,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:11.200
thinking about the time he threatened&nbsp;
her and told her to fight or run

00:22:11.760 --> 00:22:16.400
Erwin meets up with them and Levi briefs him&nbsp;
on the situation. The Survey Corps regroups in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:21.680
Orvud District in preparation to fight Rod.[101]&nbsp;
At dawn, Historia joins the others on the Wall in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:21.680 --> 00:22:26.640
preparation to defeat the gigantic Titan and&nbsp;
Levi tries to convince her to stand down,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:26.640 --> 00:22:31.600
but she pushes back using his own reasoning&nbsp;
about choosing whether to run or to fight.

00:22:31.600 --> 00:22:36.960
Levi watches the Garrison's cannon attacks against&nbsp;
Rod Reiss, noting how ineffective they are.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:36.960 --> 00:22:42.160
When the Titan reaches the Wall, Levi and his&nbsp;
squad move forward with Erwin's plan to cripple&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:42.160 --> 00:22:48.720
Rod Reiss' hands with explosives and have Eren&nbsp;
shoves barrels of gunpowder inside Rod's mouth,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:53.680
causing him to explode. The plan is a success&nbsp;
and they begin cutting down the flying pieces&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:53.680 --> 00:22:58.480
of flesh to find Rod Reiss' true body&nbsp;
and Historia is the one who kills him.

00:22:58.480 --> 00:23:01.840
Some time after the fight,&nbsp;
Levi and a subordinate find&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:05.680
Kenny sitting under a tree in the&nbsp;
woods. Kenny is heavily wounded&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:05.680 --> 00:23:09.120
and Levi sends the other soldier away, saying&nbsp;
he will be fine on his own. As if to mock him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:14.400
Kenny shows Levi one of the syringes with the&nbsp;
serum that transforms a person into a Titan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:14.400 --> 00:23:20.000
However Levi knows that if Kenny was inclined to&nbsp;
use it, he would have done so by now. Levi asks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:24.960
him about the First King and why he does not want&nbsp;
humanity to survive, but Kenny only knows that it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:30.400
was for that reason that the Ackermans opposed&nbsp;
him. When Levi, now knowing that his last name&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:30.400 --> 00:23:36.400
is Ackerman, asks Kenny what exactly was he to his&nbsp;
mother, Kenny laughs and reveals that he was her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:36.400 --> 00:23:41.120
older brother, thereby making him Levi's uncle.&nbsp;
Shocked, Levi questioned him on why he abandoned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:41.120 --> 00:23:46.480
him and is told that the reason he left Levi was&nbsp;
because he believed he was not fit to be a parent.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:46.480 --> 00:23:52.880
He gives Levi the serum just before dying as Levi&nbsp;
looked at his late uncle with a solemn expression.

00:23:52.880 --> 00:23:58.160
After Historia's coronation, Levi is confronted&nbsp;
by the new queen and the members of the Special&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:58.160 --> 00:24:02.160
Operations Squad. She punches him,&nbsp;
as Dimo Reeves had told her to do,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:02.160 --> 00:24:07.920
and she dares him to retaliate. Instead of getting&nbsp;
angry however, he smiles and thanks his friends.

00:24:07.920 --> 00:24:13.440
Two months later, Levi backs up Historia on&nbsp;
providing a home for the poor and orphans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:13.440 --> 00:24:18.080
considering that he was from the Underground&nbsp;
City as well.[107] He is present at Trost when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:18.080 --> 00:24:23.680
Hange Zoë is testing out the Executioner&nbsp;
from Hell and attends the military meeting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:23.680 --> 00:24:27.446
where Erwin Smith goes over a new expedition&nbsp;
to Shiganshina. In a private follow-up between&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:27.446 --> 00:24:30.640
the heads of the military, Erwin decides to&nbsp;
entrust Levi with the Titan injection since&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:30.640 --> 00:24:35.760
he has the highest chance of surviving. It&nbsp;
will be Levi's call if and when to use it.

00:24:35.760 --> 00:24:40.400
The next morning, Instructor Keith Shadis is&nbsp;
visited at the training camp by Eren, Hange,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:40.400 --> 00:24:46.000
Mikasa, Armin, Jean, Sasha, and Levi. The&nbsp;
reason for this is that Eren now remembers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:46.000 --> 00:24:51.040
a past memory where his father Dr. Yeager&nbsp;
met Keith after the massacre in the Reiss&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:51.040 --> 00:24:55.760
family chapel. Eren asks Keith to tell&nbsp;
him everything he knows about his father,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:55.760 --> 00:24:59.760
and they go to a house to talk. Levi&nbsp;
remarks that Keith has changed a lot&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:59.760 --> 00:25:04.960
since they last met, remembering his head full&nbsp;
of hair and then looking at his now bald scalp.

00:25:04.960 --> 00:25:08.800
Keith starts by warning them that he&nbsp;
knows nothing of Grisha's secrets,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:08.800 --> 00:25:15.280
but anyway recounts to them all his experiences&nbsp;
with him ever since they met 20 years ago,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:15.280 --> 00:25:19.520
until the day of the fall of Wall Maria&nbsp;
after Keith found Eren unconscious&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:19.520 --> 00:25:24.400
in a forest after receiving the Coordinate. A&nbsp;
furious Hange tells him that he is not the one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:24.400 --> 00:25:28.960
who decides if that information is valuable or&nbsp;
not and reprimands him for not saying anything&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:28.960 --> 00:25:34.320
about it to the Survey Corps before, prompting&nbsp;
Levi to tell Hange to stop. Hange continues to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:34.320 --> 00:25:38.960
chastise him and is only silenced when&nbsp;
they are again asked to stop by Eren.

00:25:38.960 --> 00:25:43.600
During a meeting with other members of the Survey&nbsp;
Corps, Levi sits silently and listens to Hange&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:43.600 --> 00:25:48.560
tell Erwin what Keith Shadis explained to them&nbsp;
on their visit. After the meeting is finished,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:48.560 --> 00:25:53.360
Levi waits until all the other members have&nbsp;
left and then shuts the door, intent on having&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:53.360 --> 00:25:58.640
a private conversation with Erwin. He tries&nbsp;
to persuade Erwin to sit out on the upcoming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:58.640 --> 00:26:02.240
mission to retake Wall Maria and to leave it&nbsp;
to the others, telling him that in his weakened&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:02.240 --> 00:26:08.560
state, Erwin will simply be Titan food and that he&nbsp;
is not willing to carry along any extra baggage.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:08.560 --> 00:26:13.360
Erwin however explains to Levi that the chain&nbsp;
of command must be preserved, and that he has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:13.360 --> 00:26:19.120
an intense desire to see what is in Grisha's&nbsp;
basement, which prompts Levi to threaten to break&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:19.120 --> 00:26:25.280
both of his legs. However, this does not deter&nbsp;
Erwin and Levi realizes that he will unfortunately&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:25.280 --> 00:26:30.720
not be able to change Erwin's mind, even&nbsp;
though he fears his death as a wounded soldier.

00:26:30.720 --> 00:26:35.920
Late that night at a special 'red meat' dinner,&nbsp;
Levi breaks up a fight between Eren and Jean&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:35.920 --> 00:26:40.160
by kicking and throwing them both&nbsp;
into submission. He then orders that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:40.160 --> 00:26:44.560
they and the rest of the Corps to go back to&nbsp;
their quarters and go to bed. Shortly after,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:44.560 --> 00:26:49.600
Eren, Armin and Mikasa talk about their returning&nbsp;
home and Levi listens to them while in the barn.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:49.600 --> 00:26:53.680
As he hears Armin's ambitions, his&nbsp;
expression is lowered and darkened.

00:26:53.680 --> 00:26:58.240
The next day, just before sunset, Levi&nbsp;
along with the other Survey Corps leaders&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:58.240 --> 00:27:01.600
salute the higher-ups of the brass,&nbsp;
including Darius Zackly and Commander&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:01.600 --> 00:27:06.000
Pixis. Levi watches on as the citizens of&nbsp;
the Trost District cheer for the Survey&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:06.000 --> 00:27:10.640
Corps and call out his name. He acts modest&nbsp;
and calls them selfish before seeing Erwin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:10.640 --> 00:27:16.640
cheer back at the enthusiastic civilians.&nbsp;
Right after, the 58th expedition begins,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:16.640 --> 00:27:22.240
Levi rides out with the Corps at Erwin's&nbsp;
side as he glances back at Eren and Mikasa.

00:27:22.240 --> 00:27:27.280
Near dawn, the Survey Corps walk on foot through&nbsp;
a forest on a mountain, leading their horses.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:27.280 --> 00:27:32.080
Levi questions a subordinate, asking if they&nbsp;
are still not at the bottom of the mountain,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:32.080 --> 00:27:38.400
worrying that it is almost dawn. As Squad Levi&nbsp;
talk among themselves, Jean spots a Titan and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:38.400 --> 00:27:43.360
Hange orders the Corps to halt and illuminate&nbsp;
the area, using fragments from the cave below the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:43.360 --> 00:27:48.640
Reiss Chapel. Hange then states that the Titan&nbsp;
is asleep, and the Corps continue. Eventually,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:48.640 --> 00:27:53.760
they reach Shiganshina District and ride in on&nbsp;
their horses. Erwin orders the soldiers to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:53.760 --> 00:27:58.560
wary of hidden Titans and then orders them&nbsp;
to switch to vertical maneuvering equipment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:58.560 --> 00:28:03.200
and begin the mission. The soldiers leave&nbsp;
their horses and rush toward the gate to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:03.200 --> 00:28:09.600
Shiganshina. As Eren arrives atop the inner Wall,&nbsp;
he stares at the ruins of his home town. He is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:09.600 --> 00:28:15.120
quickly urged on by Levi to get to the outer&nbsp;
gate and the two take off. As per the plan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:15.120 --> 00:28:21.440
100 soldiers covered by hoods rush to the outer&nbsp;
gate to confuse any watching enemies, making sure&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:21.440 --> 00:28:26.960
they do not know which soldier is Eren. Hange and&nbsp;
Levi wonder why there are no Titans in the area&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:26.960 --> 00:28:32.240
and Levi claims that they have fallen right into&nbsp;
the enemy's hands. However, the two agree that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:32.240 --> 00:28:37.840
they must go forward with the plan anyway as Eren&nbsp;
flies up above the gate and prepares to transform.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:37.840 --> 00:28:43.040
After Eren successfully seals the hole in the&nbsp;
Wall, Levi reminds him that they have to kill all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:43.040 --> 00:28:48.000
of their enemies, including Reiner and Bertolt&nbsp;
before their mission will truly be finished.

00:28:48.000 --> 00:28:52.400
When Reiner is discovered by one of the Survey&nbsp;
Corps members and attempts to attack Armin,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:52.400 --> 00:28:57.200
Levi attacks Reiner, shoving his blade through&nbsp;
the nape of his neck and stabbing him, before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:57.200 --> 00:29:02.560
kicking him to the ground. After seeing that&nbsp;
Reiner survived the brutal attack, Levi angrily&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:02.560 --> 00:29:08.880
laments that he was not able to kill Reiner. While&nbsp;
on the ground, Reiner shifts into his Titan form.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:08.880 --> 00:29:14.640
Levi makes his way back to Erwin's side, where the&nbsp;
latter begins issuing commands. He tasks Levi with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:14.640 --> 00:29:19.520
helping to protect the horses, believing that&nbsp;
Levi is the only soldier he can trust to take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:19.520 --> 00:29:25.600
out the Beast Titan. He arrives first, out of the&nbsp;
two squads sent, and immediately kills two Titans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:25.600 --> 00:29:31.600
ordering the soldiers under his command that&nbsp;
they cannot die. After Bertolt is thrown over&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:31.600 --> 00:29:37.200
the Wall and transforms, Levi and his soldiers are&nbsp;
bombarded by a barrage of stones and boulders from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:37.200 --> 00:29:42.960
the Beast Titan. They retreat to the Wall where&nbsp;
Erwin meets them. Levi asks about Eren and Squad&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:42.960 --> 00:29:48.640
Hange's well-being, and Erwin informs the soldiers&nbsp;
of their increasingly desperate situation.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:48.640 --> 00:29:53.600
As the young recruits fall into a panic,&nbsp;
Levi asks Erwin if he has some kind of plan.

00:29:53.600 --> 00:29:58.320
Regarding the situation, Levi gives Erwin&nbsp;
the advice to save as many lives as possible&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:58.320 --> 00:30:03.440
by "loading them on Eren" to make an escape.&nbsp;
Levi continues by saying that he will fight the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:03.440 --> 00:30:07.680
Beast Titan. Although Levi knows that there&nbsp;
is little chance of a victory, he deduces&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:07.680 --> 00:30:12.800
that there is still hope for the Survey Corps&nbsp;
if Erwin and Eren survive. But for Levi to take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:12.800 --> 00:30:19.040
down the Beast Titan, Erwin must sacrifice himself&nbsp;
and his men. At this point, Erwin is melancholic,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:19.040 --> 00:30:24.080
but Levi makes the decision and swears that he&nbsp;
will take down the Beast Titan after telling&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:24.080 --> 00:30:28.560
his commander that he must die for them. In&nbsp;
an attempt to get closer to the Beast Titan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:28.560 --> 00:30:34.000
Levi uses the line of Titans around him to his&nbsp;
advantage while in an open space. To his side,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:34.000 --> 00:30:39.840
he notices Erwin's men following closely behind,&nbsp;
fear-stricken as they ride toward their death.

00:30:39.840 --> 00:30:45.120
After Erwin and most of the Survey Corps fall&nbsp;
when charging the Beast Titan, Levi takes out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:45.120 --> 00:30:50.720
the surrounding Titans and engages Zeke. After&nbsp;
realizing what has happened, Zeke attempts to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:50.720 --> 00:30:57.440
crush Levi, who merely dodges, slicing up the&nbsp;
Titan's arm to pieces in the process. Levi then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:57.440 --> 00:31:03.120
proceeds to slash the Beast Titan's eyes, blinding&nbsp;
it, then cuts up its ankles which causes it to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:03.120 --> 00:31:08.720
topple over. Slicing open the nape, Levi thrusts&nbsp;
his blade into Zeke's mouth, commenting that his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:08.720 --> 00:31:14.800
body is heavily damaged after transforming into a&nbsp;
Titan so Zeke can not transform again while he is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:14.800 --> 00:31:16.400
busy healing it. Further thrusting his blade right&nbsp;
through Zeke's cheek and above his right eye, Levi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:16.400 --> 00:31:21.680
decides he cannot kill him yet, pondering&nbsp;
over whether there are anyone still alive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:21.680 --> 00:31:27.280
who he would use the Titan injection on and&nbsp;
have them eat Zeke to steal his Titan power.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:27.280 --> 00:31:33.040
However, Levi is interrupted and shocked when the&nbsp;
Cart Titan snatches Zeke and carries him away in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:33.040 --> 00:31:38.960
its mouth. Zeke then orders the remaining Titans&nbsp;
to kill Levi, but Levi, remembering his promise&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:38.960 --> 00:31:44.320
to Erwin, finds his resolve and begins to&nbsp;
take on the Titans and chase down Zeke.

00:31:44.320 --> 00:31:49.200
Levi pursues Zeke and the Cart Titan back to&nbsp;
Shiganshina District, where he is stopped by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:49.200 --> 00:31:54.880
his lack of supplies. He orders Eren to give him&nbsp;
all his gas and blades so that he can continue the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:54.880 --> 00:32:00.160
chase, but Eren panics and demands that Levi&nbsp;
give Armin, who has been mortally wounded,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:00.160 --> 00:32:03.920
the Titan injection he is carrying. Levi&nbsp;
hesitates, but agrees. Just as he is about to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:03.920 --> 00:32:10.000
hand Eren the injection, a recruit crawls up onto&nbsp;
the roof with Erwin, who is on the brink of death.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:10.000 --> 00:32:14.640
Levi decides that he will give it to Erwin&nbsp;
instead of Armin, which enrages Eren.

00:32:15.280 --> 00:32:21.680
Appalled at Eren and Mikasa, Levi reminds them of&nbsp;
how important Erwin's survival is, and orders them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:21.680 --> 00:32:28.160
not to let their feelings bias their decision.&nbsp;
When Eren refuses to step down, Levi forcefully&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:28.160 --> 00:32:33.520
punches his face and knocks him aside, before&nbsp;
being pinned down by an enraged Mikasa.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:33.520 --> 00:32:39.440
Eren and Mikasa try to convince Levi of Armin's&nbsp;
value, while Floch argues that Levi is correct&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:39.440 --> 00:32:45.040
to save Erwin, and a fight between them is&nbsp;
only narrowly avoided by the arrival of Hange,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:45.040 --> 00:32:51.200
who pulls Mikasa off of Levi. Levi prepares&nbsp;
to inject Erwin, but is given pause by Eren,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:51.200 --> 00:32:55.440
who tries to sway Levi by telling him&nbsp;
of Armin's dream to see the ocean.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:55.440 --> 00:32:59.440
Levi orders his comrades to leave&nbsp;
him alone while he injects Erwin.

00:32:59.440 --> 00:33:04.400
As Levi prepares to inject Erwin, he recalls&nbsp;
Armin's conversation with Eren and Mikasa about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:04.400 --> 00:33:10.240
the ocean, and Erwin's dream to see the secrets&nbsp;
locked in Eren's basement. As he begins injecting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:10.240 --> 00:33:15.040
Erwin, Levi recalls Kenny's final words about&nbsp;
people becoming slaves to their own desires,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:15.040 --> 00:33:20.320
and is surprised when Erwin lashes out&nbsp;
in his sleep, knocking away the syringe.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:20.880 --> 00:33:26.320
As he watches Erwin, Levi recalls his order to&nbsp;
Erwin to give up on his dreams and die with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:26.320 --> 00:33:31.360
rest of the Survey Corps' recruits, and the&nbsp;
look of relief on Erwin's face at the order.

00:33:31.360 --> 00:33:36.400
After injecting Armin, Levi watches as&nbsp;
Armin's mindless Titan form devours Bertolt,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:36.400 --> 00:33:42.560
and explains to a confused Floch that, after all&nbsp;
he has given, it is time for Erwin to finally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:42.560 --> 00:33:47.280
rest. Levi attempts to apologize to Erwin&nbsp;
for failing to kill the Beast Titan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:47.280 --> 00:33:51.360
but Hange informs him that Erwin has already died.

00:33:51.360 --> 00:33:56.160
On top of the Wall, Levi notices that Armin has&nbsp;
awoken. He fires a signal flare for the soldiers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:56.160 --> 00:34:00.880
to regroup. He orders Eren to tell Armin about&nbsp;
the events that occurred in the past few hours.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:00.880 --> 00:34:06.320
Armin shows remorse for the measures his comrades&nbsp;
have taken for him, but Levi advocates that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:06.320 --> 00:34:11.120
should not be regretful. Afterward, Levi&nbsp;
follows Eren, Mikasa, and Hange to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:11.120 --> 00:34:16.240
Yeager family's basement. When the group find&nbsp;
that Eren's key cannot open the locked door,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:16.240 --> 00:34:22.000
Levi proceeds to kick the door open. They inspect&nbsp;
the basement thoroughly and Mikasa finds a drawer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:22.000 --> 00:34:27.360
which needs Eren's key to unlock. Initially&nbsp;
empty, Levi discovers a false bottom and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:27.360 --> 00:34:32.320
under it are three hidden books kept intact&nbsp;
with various preservatives. They open the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:32.320 --> 00:34:37.040
first book and within it they find an&nbsp;
uncannily realistic portrait of Grisha&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:37.040 --> 00:34:42.720
standing beside a fair-haired woman and a&nbsp;
child. On the back of it, Grisha had written&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:42.720 --> 00:34:47.840
that it is not an illustration; it is called&nbsp;
a photograph and humanity has not perished.

00:34:47.840 --> 00:34:52.000
While serving their punishment in jail cells,&nbsp;
Mikasa and Eren discuss the journals and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:52.000 --> 00:34:57.680
Grisha’s memories until Hange, Levi, and Armin&nbsp;
interrupt Eren and provoke them about what they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:57.680 --> 00:35:02.480
were talking about until Levi accuses him of going&nbsp;
through a phase as a teenager and lets them go,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:03.040 --> 00:35:06.880
claiming that their sentence is being&nbsp;
cut short because of their low numbers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:06.880 --> 00:35:12.400
and their superiors failure to catch the Armored&nbsp;
and Beast Titans. The group, now with Jean,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:12.400 --> 00:35:17.920
meet Historia afterward to speak with her after&nbsp;
she finishes reading a letter left to her by Ymir.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:17.920 --> 00:35:22.400
After the meeting, everyone, including all&nbsp;
other military commanders and officials,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:22.400 --> 00:35:26.480
meet to discuss the recent expedition,&nbsp;
the journals, and the huge loss of life.

00:35:26.480 --> 00:35:30.480
Once the information obtained from Eren's&nbsp;
basement is released to the world, Hange&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:30.480 --> 00:35:36.480
and Levi meet with Roy and Peaure to discuss the&nbsp;
revelations and how the public are handling it.

00:35:36.480 --> 00:35:41.440
The royal government plans for the Survey&nbsp;
Corps to be awarded with medals in a ceremony&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:41.440 --> 00:35:46.640
for their bravery and success. Over hearing a&nbsp;
fight breaking out among the younger recruits,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:46.640 --> 00:35:52.160
Levi cuts in to stop them and tell them to&nbsp;
prepare for the beginning of the ceremony.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:52.160 --> 00:35:56.480
A military audience gathers in a large room&nbsp;
where Historia presents each of the nine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:56.480 --> 00:36:02.160
soldiers with a medal of honor in the form of a&nbsp;
dark bolo tie with the wings of freedom on it.

00:36:02.160 --> 00:36:07.600
Months later, in the summer season, Shiganshina&nbsp;
District is once again populated with people as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:07.600 --> 00:36:12.800
all the Titans had been cleared out. Finally,&nbsp;
the Survey Corps once again ventures outside&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:12.800 --> 00:36:18.240
of Wall Maria on an expedition for the first&nbsp;
time in six years. They find a trail left by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:18.240 --> 00:36:23.520
a Titan crawling along the ground, and follow&nbsp;
it until they reach the edge of Paradis Island.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:23.520 --> 00:36:28.400
Here, the Survey Corps sees the ocean for&nbsp;
the first time. Jean, Connie, and Sasha&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:28.400 --> 00:36:35.040
begin splashing and playing while Hange gleefully&nbsp;
picks up never-before-seen ocean materials such as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:35.040 --> 00:36:39.840
coral much to Levi's dismay, as he attempts&nbsp;
to caution them against touching the water.

00:36:40.640 --> 00:36:45.600
One year after the Battle of Shiganshina District,&nbsp;
Levi and other members of the Survey Corps make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:45.600 --> 00:36:51.440
contact with the Anti-Marleyan Volunteers,&nbsp;
Yelena and Onyankopon, who rebel against the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:51.440 --> 00:36:56.720
rest of the Marleyan crew on their ship. The two&nbsp;
defectors show Levi and Hange their technology,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:56.720 --> 00:37:02.000
and Levi is concerned by how greatly Hange is&nbsp;
impressed with Marley's level of advancement.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:02.000 --> 00:37:07.920
He asks if the defectors would notify Marley that&nbsp;
they have eliminated all the Titans on the island,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:07.920 --> 00:37:13.440
but Yelena says they would not. They are here&nbsp;
under orders from Zeke to free the Eldian people.

00:37:13.440 --> 00:37:17.280
Levi attends the military meeting to&nbsp;
decide whether to cooperate with Zeke&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:17.280 --> 00:37:22.720
and the Anti-Marleyan Volunteers. Though&nbsp;
he does not voice an opinion, he asks Eren&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:22.720 --> 00:37:27.360
why he withheld the information that he&nbsp;
could control the Founding Titan's power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:27.360 --> 00:37:32.320
if he is in contact with a royal-blooded&nbsp;
Titan. Not wanting to disrupt the meeting,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:32.320 --> 00:37:38.080
Levi tells Eren they will discuss this later. Once&nbsp;
the Survey Corps agrees to work with Yelena and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:38.080 --> 00:37:43.760
Onyankopan, Levi assists them in capturing the&nbsp;
soldiers sent on future Marleyan expeditions.

00:37:43.760 --> 00:37:49.280
He later participates in the infiltration&nbsp;
into Marley and the ensuing Raid on Liberio.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:49.280 --> 00:37:53.680
After the Jaw Titan sneaks behind and&nbsp;
jumps on the back of the Attack Titan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:53.680 --> 00:37:58.720
Levi takes note and goes to intercept it.&nbsp;
The Jaw Titan tries to bite into the neck&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:58.720 --> 00:38:04.560
of the Attack Titan, but Levi severs the muscles&nbsp;
in the left side of its face, rendering it unable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:04.560 --> 00:38:10.480
to rip out the nape. Then both Levi and Mikasa&nbsp;
engage it, along with many other members of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:10.480 --> 00:38:16.720
Survey Corps. The Cart Titan's Panzer Unit makes&nbsp;
a surprise attack, eliminating many of the Corps&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:16.720 --> 00:38:22.400
and forcing them to fall back. Noticing the&nbsp;
sudden arrival of Zeke Yeager's Beast Titan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:22.400 --> 00:38:27.280
Levi orders the surviving soldiers to&nbsp;
regroup and stares down the Beast Titan.

00:38:27.280 --> 00:38:33.200
Levi is on standby as the Beast Titan sends&nbsp;
debris flying into the surrounding area. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:33.200 --> 00:38:38.880
observes as the Titan calls for him to come out,&nbsp;
and later ambushes it by quickly slicing its nape,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:38.880 --> 00:38:43.440
knocking it down. Levi proceeds to&nbsp;
cut Zeke out of his Titan form and,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:43.440 --> 00:38:47.520
before grappling away, throws a&nbsp;
bomb into the Beast Titan's nape,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:47.520 --> 00:38:52.400
detonating it and demoralizing the Marley troops&nbsp;
with the presumed death of their Warchief.

00:38:52.400 --> 00:38:57.040
As the Survey Corps retreat, Levi helps Eren&nbsp;
aboard the airship and then kicks him into the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:57.040 --> 00:39:02.240
wall and places him under arrest.He takes Eren&nbsp;
to a back room where Zeke and his attendant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:02.240 --> 00:39:07.280
Yelena are. Both he and Zeke exchange&nbsp;
insults when two stowaways are brought&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:07.280 --> 00:39:11.520
to them; he listens to Hange and&nbsp;
silently agrees when Hange states&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:11.520 --> 00:39:16.400
that Eren made the entire Paradis Island&nbsp;
a target due to his actions in Marley.

00:39:16.400 --> 00:39:21.360
Once they return to the island, Levi rides&nbsp;
into the city in a carriage with Zeke. He mock&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:21.360 --> 00:39:26.480
threatens to kill Zeke, send his corpse back to&nbsp;
Marley, and then reveal everything about his plot,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:26.480 --> 00:39:31.520
which would spell the end for his grandparents.&nbsp;
However, Levi admits as long as Zeke's "secret&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:31.520 --> 00:39:35.840
plan" is real, he is willing to wait a&nbsp;
little longer before slicing him to pieces.

00:39:35.840 --> 00:39:39.920
Levi escorts Zeke to a Titan Forest&nbsp;
with a number of soldiers explaining&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:39.920 --> 00:39:43.600
that it will not be easy for him&nbsp;
to escape from such an environment.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:43.600 --> 00:39:49.840
Zeke asks Levi if he can show the trees to Gabi&nbsp;
and Falco, but Levi responds that it depends on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:49.840 --> 00:39:54.800
his own actions. Despite his reservations,&nbsp;
Levi is convinced by his subordinates to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:54.800 --> 00:39:59.920
allow them to drink wine imported from Marley&nbsp;
while they are guarding Zeke in the forest.

00:39:59.920 --> 00:40:05.840
Zeke later tells Levi about the method he had used&nbsp;
to turn the people of Ragako into Titans. After&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:05.840 --> 00:40:11.440
the explanation finishes, Levi admonishes Zeke for&nbsp;
his lack of guilt, and tells him that he clearly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:11.440 --> 00:40:17.120
has no concern for human life. He is shaken off&nbsp;
and told not to assume how he felt. Zeke changes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:17.120 --> 00:40:22.800
the subject by asking when he will be allowed to&nbsp;
carry out his experiment with Eren. Levi tells him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:22.800 --> 00:40:27.760
that this is not his call, but both agree that&nbsp;
it would be a mistake to wait around too long.

00:40:27.760 --> 00:40:32.480
After a Survey Corps messenger arrives at&nbsp;
the camp, Varis notifies Levi that Darius&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:32.480 --> 00:40:37.120
Zackly has been assassinated and also&nbsp;
informs him of Commander Pixis's plan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:37.120 --> 00:40:41.280
to deal with the Yeagerists. Dismayed to&nbsp;
hear that his friends and comrades have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:41.280 --> 00:40:46.080
essentially died for nothing to protect&nbsp;
Eren, Levi tells them they are altering&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:46.080 --> 00:40:51.360
the plan. He suggests they capture one of&nbsp;
the Yeagerists and force them to eat Zeke;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:51.360 --> 00:40:56.640
then when Historia gives birth several months&nbsp;
from now and is ready to inherit, they will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:56.640 --> 00:41:02.960
feed the Yeagerist to her. Levi orders Varis&nbsp;
to go inform Pixis and descends from the tree.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:02.960 --> 00:41:08.640
Despite the holes in this plan, Levi admits to&nbsp;
himself that he does not care about Pixis's reply.

00:41:08.640 --> 00:41:13.680
After trading a few barbs with Zeke, Levi gets&nbsp;
lost in his thoughts. He considers how he will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:13.680 --> 00:41:18.560
soon fulfill the vow he made to Erwin during the&nbsp;
Battle of Shiganshina and give meaning to his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:18.560 --> 00:41:24.480
deceased comrades. Turning around, he notices Zeke&nbsp;
running into the forest; before Levi can react,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:24.480 --> 00:41:30.000
however, Zeke lets out a piercing scream. He&nbsp;
looks on in horror as the numerous Survey Corps&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:35.600
soldiers above him begin to fall out of the trees&nbsp;
and transform into Titans. Levi is caught off&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:35.600 --> 00:41:41.200
guard but comes to his senses in time to avoid&nbsp;
one of the Titans charging him. Remembering&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:41.200 --> 00:41:46.640
how his subordinates insisted they enjoy the wine&nbsp;
offered and Zeke's comment on it from earlier,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:46.640 --> 00:41:52.800
Levi theorizes that the wine was indeed the likely&nbsp;
cause of the soldiers transforming. Noticing these&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:52.800 --> 00:41:57.760
Titans are faster and more unpredictable, he&nbsp;
reflects on if his subordinates are still inside&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:57.760 --> 00:42:04.000
and conscious of their actions. As the Titans&nbsp;
swarm around him in midair, Levi closes his eyes.

00:42:04.000 --> 00:42:09.520
Levi slaughters his former subordinates and&nbsp;
collects several Thunder Spears before chasing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:09.520 --> 00:42:16.320
down Zeke. Catching up with him, Levi kills one of&nbsp;
Zeke's three Titan escorts and meets Zeke's gaze&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:16.320 --> 00:42:22.480
with a murderous look. Levi quickly dispatches&nbsp;
another of the Titans before Zeke transforms into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:22.480 --> 00:42:27.680
the Beast Titan. As Zeke butchers the final&nbsp;
Titan and throws the bloody pieces at him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:27.680 --> 00:42:34.000
Levi dodges Zeke's attack while chopping up&nbsp;
large tree branches to hide himself in mid-air.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:34.000 --> 00:42:39.840
He criticizes Zeke for not anticipating that he&nbsp;
would be capable of killing his fellow soldiers.

00:42:39.840 --> 00:42:45.920
Falling towards Zeke, Levi fires and hits Zeke's&nbsp;
nape with four Thunder Spears before quickly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:45.920 --> 00:42:50.880
detonating them. Cutting Zeke's mangled and&nbsp;
burned body from his Titan form, Levi insults him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:50.880 --> 00:42:56.560
before dragging him out of the forest. When the&nbsp;
tied up Zeke awakens inside a horse-drawn cart,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:56.560 --> 00:43:02.320
Levi instructs him to not move, revealing that he&nbsp;
has placed the tip of a Thunder Spear inside his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:43:02.320 --> 00:43:07.760
stomach and attached the fuse around his neck.&nbsp;
Levi chastises Zeke for killing his men, before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:43:07.760 --> 00:43:12.960
starting to cut off chunks of his legs. Hearing&nbsp;
Zeke scream, Levi shouts at him to shut up,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:43:12.960 --> 00:43:18.320
explaining that this has to be done to prevent&nbsp;
him from becoming a Titan. Zeke weakly asks where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:43:18.320 --> 00:43:24.000
his glasses are but Levi brushes it aside,&nbsp;
stating he would no longer be needing them.

00:43:24.000 --> 00:43:28.800
While Levi steers the cart, Zeke begins&nbsp;
muttering about his plan to euthanize Eldia&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:43:28.800 --> 00:43:34.480
in order to ensure the world's safety. Hearing&nbsp;
this, Levi begins mocking him, saying that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:43:34.480 --> 00:43:39.840
his impending death at the hands of a Titan is too&nbsp;
merciful when considering the lives he has taken.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:43:39.840 --> 00:43:44.960
Zeke weakly protests that he was saving their&nbsp;
children from living in a cruel world, prompting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:43:44.960 --> 00:43:51.600
Levi to angrily prepare to cut off his legs again.&nbsp;
Terrified, Zeke pulls the pin on the Thunder Spear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:43:51.600 --> 00:43:57.760
lodged in his stomach; a shocked Levi is unable&nbsp;
to react and is caught in the resulting explosion.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:43:57.760 --> 00:44:02.800
The two of them are launched from the cart, and&nbsp;
Levi is sent hurling towards a nearby river.

00:44:02.800 --> 00:44:07.440
Levi's unconscious body is found shortly&nbsp;
afterwards by Hange and a group of Yeagerists.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:44:07.440 --> 00:44:11.840
When a soldier suggests shooting Levi,&nbsp;
Hange insists that he is already dead,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:44:11.840 --> 00:44:15.760
prompting Floch to request that he&nbsp;
be allowed to check for a pulse.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:44:15.760 --> 00:44:20.640
Before Floch can check, he is distracted by&nbsp;
the sight of Zeke emerging from a nearby Titan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:44:20.640 --> 00:44:24.640
allowing Hange to grab Levi's body&nbsp;
and dive into the river to escape.

00:44:24.640 --> 00:44:30.000
Since he was near Zeke when the Thunder Spear was&nbsp;
activated, Levi's face is severely scarred by the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:44:30.000 --> 00:44:35.760
resulting debris; in addition, Levi also&nbsp;
lost two of the fingers on his right hand.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:44:35.760 --> 00:44:40.720
Levi is eventually awakened from his coma&nbsp;
by a message sent by Eren to all Subjects&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:44:40.720 --> 00:44:46.080
of Ymir announcing his intentions to destroy&nbsp;
the world outside of Paradis. The two resolve&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:44:46.080 --> 00:44:51.040
to find a way to stop Eren, and Hange creates&nbsp;
a makeshift transport for Levi to be moved in.

00:44:51.040 --> 00:44:56.160
As Levi is being transported, they cross paths&nbsp;
with the Cart Titan and a Marleyan general.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:44:56.160 --> 00:44:59.760
Hange approaches the two, insisting&nbsp;
that they and Levi are harmless.[158]&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:44:59.760 --> 00:45:03.680
Levi negotiates with the soldiers,&nbsp;
pointing out that they have a common goal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:45:03.680 --> 00:45:07.360
in killing Zeke. Reluctantly, the&nbsp;
soldiers agree to work together.

00:45:07.360 --> 00:45:09.440
During the nightfall en route to harbor,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:45:09.440 --> 00:45:13.920
Levi attempts to rest but is awakened by the&nbsp;
commotion being made by the others in the camp.

00:45:14.480 --> 00:45:18.880
After daybreak, Levi would stay behind with&nbsp;
the noncombatants as his allies confront&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:45:18.880 --> 00:45:20.437
the Yeagerists at the harbor. Having decided to&nbsp;
transport the flying boat to the Marleyan coastal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:45:20.437 --> 00:45:25.680
city of Odiha, Levi and the others head towards&nbsp;
the Azumabito's ship on top of the Cart Titan.

00:45:25.680 --> 00:45:32.080
After arriving in Odiha, Armin finds Levi walking&nbsp;
despite his injuries. Levi refuses to rest any&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:45:32.080 --> 00:45:36.800
longer and insists on interrogating&nbsp;
Yelena about Eren's next destination.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:45:36.800 --> 00:45:42.480
Yelena claims that Eren is going to Fort Salta,&nbsp;
but Levi is concerned by her sudden cooperation.

00:45:42.480 --> 00:45:47.840
As the group prepares to depart Odiha, Levi&nbsp;
prepares himself for battle despite his injuries;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:45:47.840 --> 00:45:52.240
when the others wonder how he will able to&nbsp;
fight with only two fingers on one hand,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:45:52.240 --> 00:45:57.680
Levi brushes their concerns aside and merely&nbsp;
states he will manage fine. He ridicules Hange&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:45:57.680 --> 00:46:02.160
for failing to make friends with Pieck, but&nbsp;
becomes concerned when his commander begins&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:02.160 --> 00:46:07.200
musing about their fallen comrades. Preparations&nbsp;
are interrupted by Floch, who arrives in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:07.200 --> 00:46:12.960
flying boat's hangar damaging its fuel tank,&nbsp;
necessitating repairs. Eren's Titans arrive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:12.960 --> 00:46:18.160
as the repairs are being made and Hange volunteers&nbsp;
to hold them off while the ship departs.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:18.160 --> 00:46:22.560
Levi stops Hange only long enough to&nbsp;
tell them to dedicate their heart.

00:46:22.560 --> 00:46:28.160
As the flying boat reaches Eren it comes under&nbsp;
fire from the Beast Titan. Levi and his comrades&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:28.160 --> 00:46:32.880
jump from the boat and use their maneuvering&nbsp;
gear to evade the Beast's projectiles before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:32.880 --> 00:46:37.520
engaging it directly. The Beast is quickly&nbsp;
defeated, but Zeke is nowhere to be found.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:37.520 --> 00:46:42.400
The group decides to retreat to a safe distance&nbsp;
so Armin can transform and try to uncover Zeke&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:42.400 --> 00:46:48.560
with the blast, but the plan is interrupted when&nbsp;
an army of Titans begins generating on Eren's back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:48.560 --> 00:46:54.320
and absconds with Armin. Levi reassures his team&nbsp;
that Armin is unhurt, as he would have transformed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:54.320 --> 00:46:54.996
otherwise, and begins devising a plan to act as&nbsp;
bait for the Titans while the rest of the group&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:54.996 --> 00:46:59.200
tries to save him. Pieck attempts to kill Eren&nbsp;
but is defeated by the Titans, and Levi orders the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:59.200 --> 00:47:05.280
remaining soldiers to pursue Armin as he is their&nbsp;
only hope of stopping more Titans from appearing.

00:47:05.280 --> 00:47:08.960
The group does not make it far before&nbsp;
Bertolt's Colossus Titan appears.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:08.960 --> 00:47:13.280
The Colossus disables Reiner's Titan&nbsp;
and then throws it at the group,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:13.280 --> 00:47:18.560
knocking them off Eren's Titan. Levi is&nbsp;
left too injured by the impact to move,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:18.560 --> 00:47:24.160
but manages to use the last of his strength&nbsp;
to save Connie from being devoured by a Titan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:24.160 --> 00:47:29.280
However, his leg is caught in the Titan's jaw&nbsp;
and Mikasa is forced to save him. Passing out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:29.280 --> 00:47:34.960
from pain, Levi begins to fall and is only saved&nbsp;
when Connie manages to catch him. The entire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:34.960 --> 00:47:40.080
group is saved by the timely arrival of Falco,&nbsp;
who has learned to fly with his Jaw Titan form.

00:47:40.720 --> 00:47:44.880
A disagreement begins atop Falco's&nbsp;
Titan over whether to attack Eren's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:44.880 --> 00:47:50.400
nape or save Armin first and Levi makes&nbsp;
the decision to split up and do both.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:51.120 --> 00:47:56.320
Mikasa tries to protest, but Levi insists that&nbsp;
they are no longer in a position where they can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:56.320 --> 00:47:57.803
care about Eren's well-being. As his allies&nbsp;
disembark Falco to begin their objectives,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:57.803 --> 00:47:59.840
Levi laments the fact that he is too injured&nbsp;
to help. As he reflects on his inability to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:59.840 --> 00:48:05.520
carry out Erwin's final order and kill Zeke,&nbsp;
Levi begins to wonder why his comrades all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:48:05.520 --> 00:48:09.920
dedicated themselves to the Survey Corps'&nbsp;
mission. As he remembers his comrades,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:48:09.920 --> 00:48:14.320
Levi asserts that he does not regret&nbsp;
saving Armin's life over Erwin's,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:48:14.320 --> 00:48:19.200
since Armin has always had the same look&nbsp;
in his eyes that his fallen comrades did.

00:48:19.200 --> 00:48:24.560
As he observes the battle from Falco's Titan&nbsp;
Levi is perplexed to see a handful of the Titans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:48:24.560 --> 00:48:28.960
begin to defend his comrades from the rest of&nbsp;
the Titans. He is immediately brought out of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:48:28.960 --> 00:48:33.440
his stupor by the sight of Zeke emerging&nbsp;
from Eren's spine and calling out to him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:48:33.440 --> 00:48:38.240
Without hesitation, Levi decapitates&nbsp;
Zeke before returning to Falco.

00:48:38.240 --> 00:48:43.840
The group returns to Salta while Armin transforms&nbsp;
atop Eren's Titan. From the fort they are relieved&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:48:43.840 --> 00:48:49.040
to see that Reiner has survived, but are dismayed&nbsp;
to see that both Eren and the source of all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:48:49.040 --> 00:48:53.840
living matter have survived as well.&nbsp;
Connie suggests killing the source,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:48:53.840 --> 00:48:57.520
but Levi insists that they have been&nbsp;
left with no other option than to kill&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:48:57.520 --> 00:49:02.240
Eren. Before they can attack Eren&nbsp;
again, the source begins emitting smoke&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:49:02.240 --> 00:49:07.520
that billows into the fort. Realizing that the&nbsp;
smoke is going to transform the Eldians present&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:49:07.520 --> 00:49:13.520
into Titans, Levi quickly orders Mikasa and Pieck&nbsp;
to leave the fort with him on Falco so that they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:49:13.520 --> 00:49:20.000
are not put in danger by the Titans. Pieck departs&nbsp;
to help Reiner fight the centipede while Falco&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:49:20.000 --> 00:49:26.560
takes Levi and Mikasa directly to Eren. Mikasa&nbsp;
deduces that Eren is inside his Titan's mouth&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:49:26.560 --> 00:49:32.400
and Levi uses a Thunder Spear to make a&nbsp;
way for her to get inside and kill him.

00:49:32.400 --> 00:49:38.000
As the power of the Titans is undone and the&nbsp;
Eldian families begin to reunite with each other,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:49:38.000 --> 00:49:42.320
Levi rests against a rock. He sees&nbsp;
a vision of his fallen comrades&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:49:42.320 --> 00:49:46.720
watching him and asks if they were&nbsp;
able to see the result of their work.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:49:46.720 --> 00:49:50.800
The soldiers salute him in response&nbsp;
and Levi returns the salute.

00:49:50.800 --> 00:49:56.080
In the three years following the battle at Salta,&nbsp;
Levi takes up residence in Marley. His injuries&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:49:56.080 --> 00:50:00.720
leave him permanently wheelchair-bound&nbsp;
and he is attended to by Gabi and Falco.

00:50:01.760 --> 00:50:04.000
Thank you guys so much for watching this video,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:50:04.000 --> 00:50:09.280
it really means a lot to us. We will see you&nbsp;
guys very soon in one of our next videos!

